OL,3,GNEWSAApprentices helping British Steel
OL,4,Alook to the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apprentice at British Steel has said
OL,7,Fthe industry's nationalisation has
OL,8,Funited young workers looking to build
OL,9,Ftheir future.
OL,11,FThe company was taken into public
OL,12,Fownership in July after the government
OL,13,Fpassed an emergency law to take
OL,14,Fcontrol.
OL,16,FSpeaking after British Steel welcomed
OL,17,F70 new apprentices and graduates, Liam
OL,18,FLeggat, 19, said: "It's strengthened
OL,19,Fthe steelworks company and brought us
OL,20,Ftogether as apprentices. Now we're
OL,21,Fmaking a job for our future."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
