OL,3,GNEWSAApprentices helping British Steel
OL,4,Alook to the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren's commissioner for England
OL,7,FDame Rachel de Souza, whose father was
OL,8,Fa steelworker in Scunthorpe, said: "We
OL,9,Fneed more projects like these British
OL,10,FSteel apprenticeships ` more of these
OL,11,Fopportunities for young people across
OL,12,Fthe country."
